<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15">
  <head>
    <metadata>
      <ttm:title>YK?</ttm:title>
      <ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">MC Virgins</ttm:agent>
      <ttm:item type="album">After the Party</ttm:item>
      <ttm:item type="spotify_id">0ORCfJhtDL0PUjJtNQRoEQ</ttm:item>
      <itunes:duration>03:23.000</itunes:duration>
    </metadata>
    <styling>
      <style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold"/>
      <style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic"/>
    </styling>
    <layout>
      <region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center"/>
    </layout>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:09.370" end="00:11.060" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">First things first, this might be the last (ay, ay)</p>
      <p begin="00:11.060" end="00:12.840" ttm:agent="v1">I got bad blood that I gotta leave in the past</p>
      <p begin="00:12.840" end="00:14.800" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I got new money, new goals, new friends, everything (yeah)</p>
      <p begin="00:14.800" end="00:16.770" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">So many bitches who cannot get a weddin' ring (nope)</p>
      <p begin="00:16.770" end="00:18.620" ttm:agent="v1">World watchin' and they waitin' on my choice</p>
      <p begin="00:18.620" end="00:20.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Two years quiet, they been waitin' on my voice (it's Gibby)</p>
      <p begin="00:20.880" end="00:22.640" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Gotta lock in, can't deal with uncertainty (nah)</p>
      <p begin="00:22.640" end="00:25.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">How do I leave them with somethin' to say that they heard of me? (What?)</p>
      <p begin="00:25.080" end="00:26.610" ttm:agent="v1">Get outta school, I'ma need time to reset</p>
      <p begin="00:26.610" end="00:28.650" ttm:agent="v1">Four years wasted on degrees for the pretext</p>
      <p begin="00:28.650" end="00:30.430" ttm:agent="v1">But how do I use 'em? What do I choose?</p>
      <p begin="00:30.430" end="00:31.930" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Is it the music? (Ay, ay)</p>
      <p begin="00:31.620" end="00:33.970" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">And if not, will those degrees let me get what I want? (Ay, ay, ay)</p>
      <p begin="00:33.970" end="00:35.970" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Seen money as a teen, but is it gonna stop? (Nah)</p>
      <p begin="00:35.970" end="00:38.050" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Too many options, all different cost (what?)</p>
      <p begin="00:38.050" end="00:41.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">But if I never choose, never know what I lost (uh, uh)</p>
      <p begin="00:41.320" end="00:44.270" ttm:agent="v1">I'm in too deep, now I can't bail</p>
      <p begin="00:44.270" end="00:46.120" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I got so much luck that I can't fail (I can't bail)</p>
      <p begin="00:46.120" end="00:48.190" ttm:agent="v1">I got too much time that I can't tell</p>
      <p begin="00:48.190" end="00:50.430" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">And I'm on that road, but I'm fishtailin' (I can't tell)</p>
      <p begin="00:50.430" end="00:52.020" ttm:agent="v1">And sometime down the line I'll try</p>
      <p begin="00:52.020" end="00:54.070" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">To go run that back, just one more time (try to go)</p>
      <p begin="00:54.070" end="00:55.990" ttm:agent="v1">You know, want to put it all aside</p>
      <p begin="00:55.990" end="00:57.490" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">But I just can't decide (I just can't decide)</p>
      <p begin="00:57.410" end="01:01.010" ttm:agent="v1">Can't make up my mind</p>
      <p begin="01:01.010" end="01:09.010" ttm:agent="v1">Will this last just for a moment or my life?</p>
      <p begin="01:09.430" end="01:10.930" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Can't control it (can't control it)</p>
      <p begin="01:10.930" end="01:13.410" ttm:agent="v1">But you know it, you know, yeah, you know</p>
      <p begin="01:13.410" end="01:15.800" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Ay, should I bar out? I probably have to (uh)</p>
      <p begin="01:15.800" end="01:17.760" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">My fans been sayin' the projects past due (what, what?)</p>
      <p begin="01:17.760" end="01:19.770" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Hol' up, well honestly that's true (yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:19.770" end="01:21.850" ttm:agent="v1">Like it's been five years since, &quot;Prophet, is that you?&quot; Yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:21.850" end="01:23.710" ttm:agent="v1">I never called out, got caught up, I'm on now</p>
      <p begin="01:23.710" end="01:25.470" ttm:agent="v1">But will I have to wrap it up in minutes and haul out?</p>
      <p begin="01:25.470" end="01:27.310" ttm:agent="v1">It's inhibitions makin' my decision, they're drawn out</p>
      <p begin="01:27.310" end="01:29.720" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">And when I'm finished will I feel diminished? I'm gone now (ay)</p>
      <p begin="01:29.720" end="01:31.640" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">But when I'm gone, got a vision in my sight (what?)</p>
      <p begin="01:31.640" end="01:33.540" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Different sound, different space, that's my type (ay, ay)</p>
      <p begin="01:33.540" end="01:35.510" ttm:agent="v1">Move to Ganymede, bitch, I feel just like Spike</p>
      <p begin="01:35.510" end="01:39.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Type of shit that's gonna make 'em say, &quot;Yeah, hey, alright&quot; (right now)</p>
      <p begin="01:39.160" end="01:41.190" ttm:agent="v1">This shit's preem, choom, you know I can't lie, uh</p>
      <p begin="01:41.190" end="01:43.230" ttm:agent="v1">God-damn, it's so hard to leave it up to my fate</p>
      <p begin="01:43.230" end="01:45.670" ttm:agent="v1">But I'd rather die on that hill than sit and wish for my grave, I'm sayin'</p>
      <p begin="01:45.670" end="01:49.050" ttm:agent="v1">I'm in too deep, now I can't bail</p>
      <p begin="01:49.050" end="01:51.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I got so much luck that I can't fail (I can't bail)</p>
      <p begin="01:51.100" end="01:53.020" ttm:agent="v1">I got too much time that I can't tell</p>
      <p begin="01:53.020" end="01:55.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">And I'm on that road, but I'm fishtailin' (I can't tell)</p>
      <p begin="01:55.370" end="01:57.080" ttm:agent="v1">And sometime down the line I'll try</p>
      <p begin="01:57.080" end="01:58.960" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">To go run that back, just one more time (try to go)</p>
      <p begin="01:58.960" end="02:00.560" ttm:agent="v1">You know, want to put it all aside</p>
      <p begin="02:00.560" end="02:03.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">But I just can't decide (I just can't decide)</p>
      <p begin="02:03.000" end="02:05.880" ttm:agent="v1">Can't make up my mind</p>
      <p begin="02:05.880" end="02:13.880" ttm:agent="v1">Will this last just for a moment or my life?</p>
      <p begin="02:14.530" end="02:16.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Can't control it (can't control it)</p>
      <p begin="02:16.400" end="02:24.400" ttm:agent="v1">But you know it, you know, yeah, you know</p>
      <p begin="02:33.980" end="02:36.760" ttm:agent="v1">Where do we go now, go now?</p>
      <p begin="02:36.760" end="02:38.520" ttm:agent="v1">I need you to tone down</p>
      <p begin="02:38.520" end="02:40.510" ttm:agent="v1">Ain't no way to slow down</p>
      <p begin="02:40.510" end="02:44.560" ttm:agent="v1">Goin' nowhere, so where do we go now, go now?</p>
      <p begin="02:44.560" end="02:46.720" ttm:agent="v1">I need you to tone down</p>
      <p begin="02:46.720" end="02:48.680" ttm:agent="v1">Ain't no way to slow down</p>
      <p begin="02:48.680" end="02:52.210" ttm:agent="v1">Goin' nowhere, so where do we go now, go now?</p>
      <p begin="02:52.210" end="02:54.170" ttm:agent="v1">I need you to tone down</p>
      <p begin="02:54.170" end="02:56.180" ttm:agent="v1">Ain't no way to slow down</p>
      <p begin="02:56.180" end="02:59.990" ttm:agent="v1">Goin' nowhere, so where do we go now, go now?</p>
      <p begin="02:59.990" end="03:01.970" ttm:agent="v1">I need you to tone down</p>
      <p begin="03:01.970" end="03:03.810" ttm:agent="v1">Ain't no way to slow down</p>
      <p begin="03:03.810" end="03:07.740" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Goin' nowhere, so where do we go now, go now? (Can't make up my mind)</p>
      <p begin="03:07.740" end="03:09.610" ttm:agent="v1">I need you to tone down</p>
      <p begin="03:09.610" end="03:11.810" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Ain't no way to slow down (will this last just for a moment?)</p>
      <p begin="03:11.810" end="03:15.890" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Goin' nowhere, so where do we go now, go now? (Or my life?)</p>
      <p begin="03:15.890" end="03:17.900" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I need you to tone down (can't control it)</p>
      <p begin="03:17.900" end="03:19.760" ttm:agent="v1">Ain't no way to slow down</p>
      <p begin="03:19.760" end="03:22.660" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Goin' nowhere (but you know it, you know, yeah, you know), so where do we</p>
      <p begin="03:22.660" end="03:26.660" ttm:agent="v1"/>
    </div>
